& [Gates] are fail fast
  + checkpoint A focused structural debug and release plus default and all-feature workspace gates before commit
  + checkpoint B exact golden bytes, regenerated artifact equality, digest reconstruction, drift, direction, closure, reserved-key, root-set, source-lineage, and one-below-bound tests
